At the theoretical 2 resident CTAs per SM:
  Registers: 65536 / 65536 = 100%, 0 registers remain
  Shared memory: 83968 / 102400 bytes = 82%, 18432 bytes (18 KiB) remain
  Resident warps: 16 / 48 = 33.33%
  Resident threads: 512 / 1536 = 33.33%

NCU block limits per SM:
